  "description": "A saint of calligraphy and painting who has reached divine heights! From the prestigious Yemunsegae family of Hoseo, Sogaju Lee Gun-Ak has been called a prodigy since childhood. Born into a family, Gun-Ak is caught up in the conflict between the seven great clans of the Central Plains and, as a descendant of Hwaseong, demonstrates mystical calligraphy. Mysterious pursuers of unknown origins gradually approach, and he experiences the tragic murder of his father...\n\nThe life of Shin Pil-Hwa, a divine calligrapher who captures the world in his paintings!\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
